    cml:logicSummary "Regulator's actions are prohibited." ;
    cml:premiseText "(a) becomes bankrupt, applies to take the benefit of any law for the relief of bankrupt or insolvent debtors, compounds with his or her creditors or makes an assignment of his or her remuneration for their benefit;" ;
    cml:conclusionText "the Governor-General must terminate his or her appointment." ;
    cml:executionSurface "modalities::logic::deontic" ;
